Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.47,0:00:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,My pops into would use\Nsomething like meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.38,0:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,oh you're like, I'm just like\Nboys, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.37,0:00:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummoo! Yummoo! Yummoo! Yummoo! Yummoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.27,0:00:18.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh! Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.63,0:00:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yu-Gi-Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.65,0:01:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Once your Kareebo's\Ndestroyed, you lose, Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.03,0:01:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.19,0:01:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I win the duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.75,0:01:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you and your friends\Nare trapped here forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.99,0:01:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've finally proven my point!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.29,0:01:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,See, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's superior to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You wish! Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.63,0:01:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.21,0:01:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Kaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.45,0:01:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, he didn't lose any life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.91,0:01:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.49,0:01:33.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You look shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.27,0:01:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have lost the\Nrest of your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.41,0:01:39.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a closer look, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.43,0:01:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You activated a trap. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.25,0:01:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a card known as Neutron Z.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.99,0:01:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Since your attack was strong enough\Nto wipe out 2,000 of my life points,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.07,0:01:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to activate my Nutrient\NZ trap card to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.81,0:01:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,So I received an additional 4,000 life\Npoints before your attack did any damage
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.53,0:02:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't get rid of me that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.11,0:02:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah Thanks to my cards and to my\Nfriends But not for long, Yugi Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.73,0:02:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time one of your\Nturns comes to an end, I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.85,0:02:18.73,Default,,0,0,0,,transform another one of\Nyour friends into stone Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.69,0:02:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi Because my turn is far from done Next,\Nmy Deck Master Special Ability kicks in,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,boosting up my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.47,0:02:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then I'll activate this,\Nthe Magic Card Semek's Blessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.33,0:02:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,This raises my strength by the same\Nnumber of points you just lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:41.17,Default,,0,0,0,,giving me a grand total\Nof 10,500 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.25,0:02:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, my Yamata Dragon Spirit\NMonster will return to my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.91,0:02:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you remember what\Nthat means, don't you, Yugi?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.73,0:02:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Spring of Rebirth activates,\Nstrengthening me more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.71,0:02:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got 11,000 life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.09,0:03:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,How's Yugi gonna get him down to zero?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.37,0:03:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.28,0:03:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah's getting stronger, and\Nwith every turn that passes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.61,0:03:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,he transforms someone else into a statue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let this insanity continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.53,0:03:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to beat Noah and set us\Nall free before it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.89,0:03:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I play the mighty Alpha the\NMagnet Warrior in attack mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Noah's life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.39,0:03:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I have so much power that\NI barely felt a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.07,0:03:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.79,0:03:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I have to keep my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,By encasing one more of\Nyour friends in stone now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him win, Yugi! No! Tristan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you back, Tristan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.25,0:03:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, this must stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It will stop when I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.15,0:03:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But by then, you'll all be trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.87,0:04:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Yugi's gonna shut this place down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.79,0:04:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll all be free, so you can\Nthreaten whoever you want, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.61,0:04:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever I want?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.33,0:04:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So I guess that includes\Nyour sister, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine, if Yugi doesn't win\Nthis turn, she's next!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.01,0:04:14.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.31,0:04:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,There's still a chance to save them, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.17,0:04:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If not, then too bad. Your friends\Nwill be a bunch of stiffs forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,soon I'll prove that no one's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,better than me my move and I summon
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.63,0:04:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,the spirit monster in a white\Nrabbit it has the ability to hop
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,over all your monsters and go\Nstraight Wait for your life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.21,0:04:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.09,0:04:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,White Rabbit, attack him now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.61,0:04:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Behind you! My car!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.25,0:04:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,White Rabbit, return!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.77,0:05:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,whenever a card returns to my hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.47,0:05:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my two magic cards give my\Nlife points a major boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.91,0:05:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, this is nuts!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.15,0:05:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.06,0:05:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi can handle this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.11,0:05:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.21,0:05:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,First, I place one card\Nface down on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll sacrifice Alpha the Magnet Warrior\Nin order to summon Dark Magician Girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And since I have a Dark\NMagician card in my graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.93,0:05:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,she gains an additional\N300 attack points now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.97,0:05:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Dark Magician girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.97,0:05:44.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack Noah's lane points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.55,0:05:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.19,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to save Joey's sister,\Nyou'll have to do better than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.47,0:05:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So why don't you try again? I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to end my turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.21,0:06:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to lose another friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye, Serenity!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.85,0:06:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity! Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.53,0:06:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.27,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Serenity, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.15,0:06:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.63,0:06:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If you really cared, you wouldn't\Nhave let that happen, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, time to bring back an old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You remember my Inaba\NWhite Rabbit, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.43,0:06:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I do, and I'm glad to see him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,His arrival has triggered\Nmy trap card, Dark Renewal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.01,0:06:50.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.51,0:06:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you summon a monster,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.19,0:06:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Renewal allows me to bring a\Nspellcaster back from my graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.21,0:07:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But first, I must sacrifice one of\Nyour creatures and one of mine so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.83,0:07:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,why don't you and I get down to\Nbusiness Noah first say goodbye to your
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.99,0:07:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,another white rabbit then I'll\Nsacrifice my big shield gardener and
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.23,0:07:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,now I can bring back a monster that\Nyou destroyed earlier in our duel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.67,0:07:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.25,0:07:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have the power of two Dark\NMagicians on my side of the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.79,0:07:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah And it looks to me like\Nyou have no monsters left
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.65,0:07:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll place one card\Nface down, and I'll end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,my turn for now You have\Nnothing to defend you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.25,0:07:43.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So your life points are wide open And it's
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.49,0:07:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,about time I turn this duel\Naround So stand back, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.09,0:07:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.57,0:07:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, prepare to release me and\Nmy friends from your twisted game!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For I activate Dark Magic Rituals!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.11,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This magic card allows me to summon a dark\Nmagical creature once I make a sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll sacrifice this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.29,0:08:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My all-powerful Valkyra,\Nthe Magna Warrior!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.45,0:08:14.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Valkyra, be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.31,0:08:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I shall summon my third Magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.97,0:08:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The Magician of Black Chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.05,0:08:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This monster completes my trio of magical
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.23,0:08:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,beasts that will combine\Nforces to take you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When added together,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.53,0:08:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Magician Girl, and Magician of Black\NChaos have over 7,000 attack points!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.05,0:08:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost enough to wipe you out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got three Dark Magicians?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, but he never had\Nthem all on the field at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.39,0:08:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the break Yugi needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, this is for my friends!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.25,0:08:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Combine forces, my magicians!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.67,0:09:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And strike his life points directly!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:10.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The combined strength of my\Nmagicians will render you weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.73,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate Trap Card!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You just triggered my Chaos Barrier Field.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.69,0:09:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.93,0:09:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,He stopped my triple Dark Magic Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.83,0:09:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,My points are still safe. However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.03,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,yours are in a great deal of danger, so\Nwatch closely as my Trap Card takes effect,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,pitting your strongest and your\Nweakest monster against one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.91,0:09:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Dark Magician Girl, Feel the wrath\Nof your friend, Magician of Black Chaos!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.01,0:09:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.03,0:09:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true, your big plan to\Ndefeat me just failed miserably.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.51,0:09:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And all the life points you\Njust lost go directly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.45,0:09:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's ahead by 9,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.83,0:10:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Bravo, Yugi, bravo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.29,0:10:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You've put on such a great\Nshow, I see no need to continue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll transform your friends back\Nto normal and we can end this duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.83,0:10:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't toy with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.69,0:10:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:16.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask only one little\Nfavor in return, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That you forfeit the duel and\Nadmit that I am superior to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.23,0:10:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems a small price to pay for\Nyour friend's safe return, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.37,0:10:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, Seto and Mokubo will\Nremain as they are and stay with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.43,0:10:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You slimeball! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch what you say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.87,0:10:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be next.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play with\Npeople's lives like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.71,0:10:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hugh, you can beat this little dwarf\Nbaron square and end his sick game!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.47,0:10:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I'm defeated?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't lose, Hugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember asking\Nfor your opinion, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,So say goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.67,0:10:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Chewie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.13,0:10:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Not you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.55,0:11:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.59,0:11:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're really tough, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.87,0:11:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.78,0:11:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think you're just a\Nspoiled brat who's got no guts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.21,0:11:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,If things aren't going your way,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.41,0:11:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you just keep changing all\Nthe rules until they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.13,0:11:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I really care\Nwhat you think of me, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.21,0:11:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already proven that there's no\None out there who's better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.83,0:11:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's up to Yugi to admit the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll gladly reverse\Nthe damage that's been done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.37,0:11:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like I've got some\Ndisappointing news for you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I still plan to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.34,0:11:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.51,0:11:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Then suit yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.23,0:11:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I tried to make things easy for\Nyou, but you chose the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.35,0:11:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I play a monster in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.73,0:11:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And next I'll play one card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, since I can't lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.53,0:11:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,there's no harm in showing you the\Nnext card I'm about to play, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.47,0:11:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.65,0:11:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ta-da!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.07,0:12:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When your turn starts,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.85,0:12:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll use groundbreaking to bring\Nback one of my spirit monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,a little critter known\Nas Inaba White Rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.47,0:12:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He possesses 700 attack points, which\Nis more than enough to wipe you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.29,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So once he attacks you\Ndirectly, you're finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.57,0:12:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Now make your final move, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't won this yet, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.39,0:12:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.67,0:12:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Go groundbreaking!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,This brings my Inaba White\NRabbit right back to my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But not for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate Card Destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.17,0:12:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you must discard your entire\Nhand, including your White Rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Then draw four more cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It all stops here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.77,0:12:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Magician of Black Chaos,\Ndestroy his Facetown Monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.07,0:12:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yugi, but you've just\Nactivated Otohime's special ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.79,0:13:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,So feast your eyes on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.65,0:13:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Otohime, target Yugi's Dark Magician\Nand switch him into defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.91,0:13:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like you'll be\Nattacking me anymore this turn, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,But since you did manage to\Ndestroy one of my spirit monsters,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you've triggered yet another trap card.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.51,0:13:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Vessel of Illusion allows\Nme to summon a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So Otohime, return now in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.01,0:13:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn's over, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.75,0:13:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And it looks to me like you've only\Ngot one friend left down there. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.09,0:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Taya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon she'll be nothing more than\Na statue of her former self.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.03,0:13:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,In your dreams, you creep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.99,0:13:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi's gonna crush you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.97,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then he'll set us all\Nfree. You got that, Taya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.15,0:13:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll spare you for one more turn, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.27,0:13:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can witness Yugi's defeat and see\Njust how wrong you are about your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.61,0:13:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking of your defeat...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:14:00.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I activate the magic\Ncard, Change of Heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.39,0:14:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows me to control\None of your monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.51,0:14:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess who is now mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.75,0:14:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.66,0:14:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My dark magician!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.89,0:14:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now your favorite monster\Nstands by my side, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I shall sacrifice\Nhim along with my Otohime.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.89,0:14:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to summon the most\Npowerful spirit in all of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.83,0:14:22.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hino Kagu Tsuchi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.63,0:14:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll play the magic\Ncard, Flaming Fist.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This adds 200 extra attack\Npoints to my beast for one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.01,0:14:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The end is just about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.87,0:14:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hinokagutsuchi, destroy his\Nmagician of black chaos now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like my newest spirit monster\Nhas destroyed all your monsters, and
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.85,0:15:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the special ability of my deck\Nmaster an additional 700 life points
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.47,0:15:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,are added to my total now i'll play\Nspiritual energy settle machine it lets
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.31,0:15:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,me keep a spirit monster on the field\Nafter i discard one card from my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.41,0:15:18.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You may as well stay down, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.53,0:15:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.83,0:15:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't listen to him,\NYugi! Get up! Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.57,0:15:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.65,0:15:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I still believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.27,0:15:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Teya!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.77,0:15:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, this should quiet things down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.49,0:15:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could speak, Yugi, I'm sure you'd\Nadmit now that I'm the better duelist.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.45,0:15:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no monsters in play, no cards in\Nyour hand, and no friends to cheer you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.49,0:15:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all alone now, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one left to support you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.19,0:15:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.84,0:15:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm here, you can't be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.79,0:16:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm not the only\None who's here. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.15,0:16:09.09,Default,,0,0,0,,All you have to do is look inside\Nyour heart and inside your mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,and you'll see that your\Nfriends are never far.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.55,0:16:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't see anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.11,0:16:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen this room before, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.71,0:16:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It holds your recent memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.75,0:16:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey, Taya, and Tristan,\NDuke Devlin, and Serenity.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I understand now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.67,0:16:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as our friends are in our\Nthoughts, they'll never be too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.03,0:16:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well put, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll always be right here\Nin your mind no matter what
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,that's right You may not\Nremember your ancient past yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.23,0:16:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but you still remember us
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.25,0:16:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.69,0:16:51.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm afraid I have nothing\Nleft to fight with that's pathetic
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:55.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you telling me my future's\Nin the hands of a quitter?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.13,0:16:57.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba, Mokuba,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.29,0:17:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't let that little punk\NNoah win this duel Yugi I know
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.37,0:17:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then get back in the game and\Nface him like a man Remember,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.77,0:17:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you have my cards, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.31,0:17:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And with the power of my deck\Nin your hands, you can't lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.61,0:17:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,There may still be a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.59,0:17:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It lies in Kaiba's deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.47,0:17:17.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't mess up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.99,0:17:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You've only got one shot left.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I will save my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.61,0:17:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just watch me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.19,0:17:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You insist on humiliating\Nyourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.57,0:17:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop until you're defeated, Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I play Card of Sanctity.\NSo we both have to draw from
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.43,0:17:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,our decks Until each of us is\Nholding six cards in our hand
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.45,0:17:51.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi. We're all here. Now draw six\Ncards. One from each of us. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pal, take this. Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.53,0:18:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go This is for you I\Nhope it helps Now give that brat
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.17,0:18:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,a spanking The hearts of all our\Nfriends are in these six cards!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.27,0:18:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.63,0:18:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the support of my\Nfriends, I'm about to defeat you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and that is something\Nyou'll never understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.97,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I play Monster Reborn!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.27,0:18:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It can revive any monster\Nyou sent to the graveyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.47,0:18:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,including Kaiba's Blue-Eyes White Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.87,0:18:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.81,0:18:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, it can!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, Noah, this duel\Nbegan as you against Kaiba,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.49,0:18:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And you destroyed his Blue-Eyes White\NDragon, so I was able to bring it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I activate this card!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.79,0:18:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Polymerization!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.81,0:18:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,This allows me to fuse my\NBlue-Eyes on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,with the two other\NBlue-Eyes cards in my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.87,0:18:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, behold the power of my\NBlue-Eyes Ultimate Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.11,0:18:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The strongest monster in Kaiba's deck!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid there's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.93,0:19:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Next, I'll activate my\NQuick Attack Magic card.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.01,0:19:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,This lets my dragon attack right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.67,0:19:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hino Kakosuchi is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Noah, you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:20.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to the next magic card\Nin my hand, D-Fusion. Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It separates my beasts back\Ninto three separate dragons,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.63,0:19:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,each with 3,000 attack points.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.73,0:19:28.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, no! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.65,0:19:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been exposed as the\Nfrightened child you truly are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.41,0:19:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,For Kaiba and Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And for all my other friends as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.27,0:19:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Dragons! Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.49,0:19:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wipe him out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.83,0:19:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,This madness is finally over, Noah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.67,0:20:04.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
